menu "Storage configuration"

config STORAGE_RECORDING_CAP_BYTES
    int "Recording storage cap (bytes)"
    default 4194304
    help
        Soft cap enforced by the storage component on top of internal flash
        (the "storage" SPIFFS partition is 6MB total per partitions.csv, but
        that's shared with future prompt/clip assets -- this 4MB default
        leaves ~2MB of headroom on the partition for those. Oldest files are
        deleted automatically to stay under this cap when a new one is
        written. Not used once a microSD backend exists -- SD capacity is
        used as-is.

endmenu
